    {
      "id": "14B0B5A57748F8AD",
      "title": "&f&lChoose space for a real town&r",
      "description": [
        "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
        "&fUnderstand this part of your adventure.",
        "",
        "&fMineColonies has its own building, worker and research progression. Plan a location with room for buildings, roads and later expansion; inspect the native colony guide before placing the first layout.",
        "",
        "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
        "&fPreview buildings and routes before filling the area with machines.",
        "",
        "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
        "",
        "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
