      "title": "&f&lHomes, food and work&r",
      "description": [
        "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
        "&fComplete the project described below.",
        "",
        "&fA settlement needs housing, food access and suitable jobs according to MineColonies’ native requirements. Grow one manageable neighborhood before creating demand across a huge unfinished town.",
